            "sid": "MAT 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in those days cometh John the Baptist, preaching in the wilderness of Judæa, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Repent ye; for the kingdom of heaven is at hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this is he that was spoken of through Isaiah the prophet, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then cometh Jesus from Galilee to the Jordan unto John, to be baptized of him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But John would have hindered him, saying, I have need to be baptized of thee, and comest thou to me? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jesus answering said unto him, Suffer ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " now: for thus it becometh us to fulfil all righteousness. Then he suffereth him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus, when he was baptized, went up straightway from the water: and lo, the heavens were opened unto him, and he saw the Spirit of God descending as a dove, and coming upon him; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and lo, a voice out of the heavens, saying, This is my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
